Size: 3562
MD5sum: a36ccb74e16437b885b08f93b525ab10
SHA1: ba37402abe0392a8eafd28dc27067e6bc60d8515
SHA256: 705d5b34853e136dcc65798bf1571a93972e13a11151b78b0a8e0fcaa94b20d7

